                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ( DOSPARM - Parameter passing from dos to forthought   9-26-85)                                                                 : >TIB ( addr count -- \ move the sting referred to by the )      ( stack to the terminal input buffer and append a null.)        >IN OFF  2DUP TIB @ SWAP CMOVE  TIB @ + OFF DROP ;                                                                            HEX                                                             : DOSPARM ( -- \ interpret parameters passed from dos)            81 80 C@   ( addr count --)                                     >TIB INTERPRET ;                                              DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         